# Every image builds with the repository root as context (compose
# `context: .`) but copies only the paths re-included below (see the
# Dockerfiles). Everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!shared
!services
!infra/scheduler

# Never inside an image, even under the paths above
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.vscode
services/*/shared
